es an organization that provides  legal services for refugees and  immigrants this happens more than you  can realize because people are desperate  to flee other countries and come to this  country and they will take even extreme  measures such as this to find that  freedom investigators don't know how  long people were stuck in that truck the  driver was arrested 60 year-old James  Bradley of Clearwater Florida he'll be  arraigned on federal charges later this  morning the truck is registered to pile  transportation out of Iowa its owner has  not responded to our request for comment  Charlie mark thanks
 

